    "scale_o_faq_collection": {
      "type": "scale-o-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Is Scale-O salt-free water softener suitable for apartments?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Scale-O is designed for houses, villas and bungalows with an overhead water tank you can access. Apartments without a private overhead tank are not the fit. See the <a href=\"/collections/water-softeners\">water softener for home</a> collection and <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank water softener guide</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does Scale-O require plumber installation?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Scale-O is a DIY salt-free water softener placed inside the overhead tank, with no plumbing cut-in or wiring. Learn install basics in the <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank softener</a> article.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does Scale-O use salt like traditional softeners?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Scale-O is salt-free and does not need salt bags or regeneration discharge. Compare <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based water softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Is Scale-O suitable for whole-house water supply?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Treating water at the overhead tank helps protect bathrooms, kitchen and appliances fed from that tank. Shop <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini</a>, <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi</a> and <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi</a> by tank size.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does Scale-O require electricity?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Scale-O works without electricity or external power, which is ideal for terrace overhead tanks. See <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">water softener price and plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Which Scale-O model should I choose for my tank?",
            "answer": "<p>Match tank capacity: <a href=\"/products/mini-water-softener-500l-750l-tanks\">Mini (500L-750L)</a>, <a href=\"/products/semi-water-softener-1000l-1500l-tanks\">Semi (1000L-1500L)</a>, <a href=\"/products/centi-water-softener-2000l-2500l-tanks\">Centi (2000L-2500L)</a>. Two tanks? Check <a href=\"/pages/water-softener-plans\">combo plans</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Water softener for home vs bathroom softener: which do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>A water softener for home at the overhead tank protects bathrooms, kitchen, geysers and washing machines. A bathroom or shower unit only treats one tap. Scale-O is a salt-free tank insert for houses and villas with a private overhead tank, not typical apartments.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "What is a salt-free water softener?",
            "answer": "<p>A salt-free water softener conditions hard-water minerals instead of swapping them with salt. Scale-O sits in your overhead tank, needs no electricity or salt bags, and helps reduce scale on taps, geysers and tiles. Compare <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based water softeners</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Does a water softener reduce hair fall from hard water?",
            "answer": "<p>Hard water hair fall in India is often breakage from mineral film, not medical shedding. A salt-free water softener in the overhead tank can help hair feel less dry and brittle. Scale-O does not claim to stop balding. Read <a href=\"/blogs/articles/hard-water-hair-breakage-vs-shedding\">hard water hair fall: breakage vs shedding</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_10": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "What is a water softener for overhead tank?",
            "answer": "<p>A water softener for overhead tank sits inside your storage tank and treats water before it reaches bathrooms, kitchen and appliances. Scale-O is salt-free, installs without a plumber, and suits 500L-2500L tanks. See the <a href=\"/blogs/articles/best-overhead-tank-water-softener-india\">overhead tank buyer guide</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_11": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Salt-free vs salt-based water softener: which is better for Indian homes?",
            "answer": "<p>Salt-based softeners can drop hardness more but need salt, drain and often a plumber. A salt-free water softener like Scale-O fits Indian overhead-tank homes: no salt, no electricity, DIY drop-in, and helps reduce scale. Read <a href=\"/blogs/articles/salt-free-vs-salt-based-water-softeners\">salt-free vs salt-based</a>.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_12": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "enabled": true,
            "product_scope": "any",
            "question": "Do I need RO if I use a water softener for home?",
            "answer": "<p>Keep RO for drinking if you already use it. A water softener for home treats the overhead tank supply for bathing, kitchen lines and appliances. Scale-O is not a drinking-water purifier. Use RO for potable water and Scale-O for whole-house scale protection.</p>",
            "category": ""
          }
        }
      },
